    <color r="255" g="255" b="255">
     <font name="Gulim" size="12" shadowx="2" shadowy="1" shadowa="50">Fun Facts about the Ribbon Seal</font>
    </color>
   </cell>
   <p />
   <cell width="280" bgimg="ui/zoopedia/factBG.tga" padx="10">
    <p />
    <cell width="32" pady="10">
     <img src="ui/zoopedia/fact-bullet.tga" sx="0" sy="0" sw="32" sh="32" />
    </cell>
    <cell width="202" pady="10">
     <color r="255" g="255" b="255"><font name="Gulim" size="10">Despite Ribbon Seals are not shy, there is not many information known about them.</font></color>
    </cell>
	<cell width="32" pady="10">
		<img src="ui/zoopedia/fact-bullet.tga" sx="0" sy="0" sw="32" sh="32" />
	</cell>    
    <cell width="202" pady="10">
     <color r="255" g="255" b="255"><font name="Gulim" size="10">The function of the inflatable air sack on the right side of their chest is still unknown.</font></color>
    </cell>
	<cell width="32" pady="10">
		<img src="ui/zoopedia/fact-bullet.tga" sx="0" sy="0" sw="32" sh="32" />
	</cell>            
    <cell width="202" pady="10">
